# This application does not load an API key from .env.
# Enter your own DeepSeek API Key in the native app: Settings > DeepSeek API.
# This device shares the credential across personas; usage is counted per persona.
# Windows: Credential Manager. Android: Keystore-protected encrypted private file.
# Never put secrets in VITE_ variables, source code, SQLite business tables, or Git.
# Chat model/personality/context limits are saved through the in-app settings.
# Production endpoint is fixed to https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions.
